This project began from the Stonkfly connectome experiment by nftechie
(https://github.com/nftechie/stonkfly) and diverged from it: the trading and
exchange modules were removed, and the character-selection and brick-breaker
tasks, the retinal population decoder, the web interface and the validation
tooling were written afterwards.

The upstream project is MIT licensed. Its copyright notice is retained in
LICENSE alongside this project's own, as that licence requires.

assets/stonkfly.png originates from that upstream project and is still used as
a presentation asset by the local web console.

Data: the MaleCNS v1.0 connectome is downloaded at run time from its own
publishers and is not redistributed here. See docs/model.md.
